From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude Opus 5.5" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:17:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/39] IbashoAgent move/stop and uploadMesh

move holds movement control flags from an idle callback for a set time, as held keys do but
without window focus; llTakeControls scripts (vehicles) see them. stop ends it; move_done events.
uploadMesh drives the model upload floater: load .dae/.gltf/.glb for the high LOD, calculate the
fee, upload, within IbashoMaxUploadCost and the pay caps (quote mode too). One friend line in
llfloatermodelpreview.h.
